# Design Narrative
# Mechanic: Optional graveyard cards pay generic mana through delve.
# Forcing: Treasure Cruise is the only card in hand and draws the winning spell.
# AI behavior: No other hand cards or creatures create alternative interactions.
# Failure modes: Win proves the delve cast, draw and continued spell casting.
# A stalled cast exposes missing payment selection or payment failure.
# Card roles: Treasure Cruise draws Lightning Bolt; Bolt deals lethal damage.
# Mana roles: Islands pay blue; Mountain pays for Bolt; Graveyard lands pay delve.
# Life totals: The opponent has exactly three life for a single Bolt.
# Protocol path: Cast, cost selection, graveyard exile, payment, draw, target.
